--- !u!114 &390720806
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 390720804}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: af6c11f0d531f4249801ea5c2de41bcb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableTrigger
  interactionPrompt: Read
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5face2da520a6fa4fa8eff1c614aff70, type: 3}
  fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e4cf2c21c93fda745b09b91b791a22c2, type: 2}
  overrideAlignment: 0
  textAlignment: 257
  overrideMargins: 0
  textMargins: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  overrideLineSpacing: 0
  lineSpacing: 0
  overrideFontSize: 1
  fontSize: 18
  overrideFontColor: 0
  fontColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  pages:
  - "Recovered Field Note, Informal Designation:\n\u201CThe Wraith\u201D\nLocation
    withheld\n\nThe ledger bears its mark before I see a body.\n\nI have walked these
    grounds for years, and yet the air changes when it passes. It is not seen, not
    in the way one expects a creature to appear. Only the silence gives it away.\n\nThose
    it chooses do not flee. There is no chase. There is no struggle. By the time
    anyone notices, it has already claimed them. There is no mistaking it; this entity
    appears to be the most dangerous among the documented."
  - "It is drawn to strength. The capable, the defiant, the prepared, they are its
    prey. The weak may go unnoticed, but the strong... those it deems worthy, are
    ended with precision. No survivor can recount the encounter. Only the evidence
    remains, subtle and cruel.\n\nI do not know how it moves, or where it comes from.
    \nReports only conclude that encounters with this creature will not result in
    a conventional hunt."
  enableLowSanityOverride: 0
  lowSanityThreshold: 0.25
  lowSanityOverrides:
    overridePages: 0
    pages: []
    overrideBackground: 0
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    overrideAlignment: 0
    textAlignment: 257
    overrideMargins: 0
    textMargins: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
    overrideLineSpacing: 0
    lineSpacing: 0
    overrideFontSize: 0
    fontSize: 24
    overrideFontColor: 0
    fontColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
    enableShake: 0
    shakeIntensity: 2
    shakeSpeed: 25
